{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《美食新聞報道》主持們全港搜羅高質美食，由食評家 KC、波波（黃婧靈）、黃嘉雯、胡美貽、蔡景行及陳若思帶路，穿梭中環、尖沙咀及深水埗，試盡異國風味、爆膏中菜及星級街坊米線！</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">食評家 KC 同波波黃婧靈率先來到中環一間地道印度餐廳，多款充滿香料特色的招牌菜令人大讚：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Punjab Warrios </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：中環擺花街18-20號嘉寶商業大廈地舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cc6c7795-58ea-4ab9-89f5-4ecc963a73f7.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026TgrBancLCR1788144312.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cc6c7795-58ea-4ab9-89f5-4ecc963a73f7.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"92f82eb7-340a-45a6-9543-a1b0bf02852f.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026NlMPMH02ib1788144311.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"92f82eb7-340a-45a6-9543-a1b0bf02852f.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"905baf7d-e6ee-4931-a478-ebe0e29d76a6.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026ZzFvtJThy81788144311.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"905baf7d-e6ee-4931-a478-ebe0e29d76a6.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">第二站由黃嘉雯與胡美貽帶路前往尖沙咀一間隱世中菜館，據悉其魅力大到連不少長者也樂意爬 18 級樓梯前來光顧：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">志成小館 </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：尖沙咀漆咸道南71號安年大廈1樓</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e93d2bb8-65f3-4df2-a338-39adb18b1d46.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026TrRSTjbNuS1788144311.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e93d2bb8-65f3-4df2-a338-39adb18b1d46.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"67fd3418-9779-4a08-b01c-9f5bbc56916a.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026qJoB7UUh1B1788144312.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"67fd3418-9779-4a08-b01c-9f5bbc56916a.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d5bb34a8-b5a8-4e56-ab60-7142e5b7dad5.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026lKRrEN3Gjo1788144313.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d5bb34a8-b5a8-4e56-ab60-7142e5b7dad5.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今集最後一站由蔡景行和陳若思踏足深水埗一間極受藝人追捧的街坊米線名店：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中華米線</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：深水埗元州街77-81號置安閣地下C號舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a6bf4ec2-e133-4c49-8b9e-6c67bb7e2a11.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026G2dsY4HF2P1788144313.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a6bf4ec2-e133-4c49-8b9e-6c67bb7e2a11.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cc804f9a-75ad-41c3-9f1f-f189685968a4.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20263u3woMOJsp1788144313.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cc804f9a-75ad-41c3-9f1f-f189685968a4.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2e805b26-04f7-45a3-beb0-89ba419784b6.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026jTgR2P4OqI1788144313.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2e805b26-04f7-45a3-beb0-89ba419784b6.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-31T14:40:40.163011+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":9,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}